[gotcha.authority_api]
observed = "The continuation ruling names connect_node as the network authority producer, but its current signature accepts lifecycle keys only; native submission needs ReceiptPolicy, and connect_node_with_policy contacts the node immediately. The policy configuration method preserves all network checks while allowing the unavailable-endpoint test to exercise the actual transport failure."

